WEBVTT

00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:04.760
(EFFORT GRUNT)

00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:07.360
(SLOW GASPING)

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:08.400
(GASPS)

00:00:10.680 --> 00:00:13.680
A-ha-ha!
(DRAMATIC MUSIC)

00:00:13.720 --> 00:00:14.840
(PANICKED GROANING)

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:17.520
(GROANS)

00:00:17.560 --> 00:00:19.680
(FLAMES ROAR)

00:00:19.720 --> 00:00:21.200
(IMPACT THUD)
(IMPACT GRUNT)

00:00:23.920 --> 00:00:27.360
Get away from him!
Destroy the kid!

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:28.600
(GROWLS)

00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:32.360
(YELLING)

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:37.640
Oh!

00:00:38.560 --> 00:00:40.360
Yes!
(IMPACT GRUNTS)

00:00:41.360 --> 00:00:42.840
(LAUGHS WICKEDLY)

00:00:42.880 --> 00:00:44.680
(GROANING, SHOUTING)

00:00:44.760 --> 00:00:46.280
NO!

00:00:46.320 --> 00:00:48.360
(SQUEAKING)

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:52.440
How does it feel to be beaten
by a tubby little punk?

00:00:52.480 --> 00:00:54.000
(LAUGHS)

00:00:54.040 --> 00:00:55.960
(SQUEAKING)

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:58.720
You guys were amazing!

00:00:58.760 --> 00:01:01.600
The kung fu,
where did that come from?

00:01:01.640 --> 00:01:04.200
Obviously, you guys are rehired.

00:01:04.240 --> 00:01:06.680
(WHIRRING) (GASPS)

00:01:06.720 --> 00:01:10.240
(CHUCKLES) (SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:01:10.280 --> 00:01:12.760
(LAUGHTER)

00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:17.000
(SLOW, CINEMATIC MUSIC)

00:01:22.640 --> 00:01:25.360
(SQUEAKING)

00:01:26.680 --> 00:01:28.680
(WHIMPERS)
It's all yours, sir.

00:01:29.840 --> 00:01:32.600
(INDISTINCT CHATTER)

00:01:32.640 --> 00:01:34.040
(GASPS)

00:01:34.080 --> 00:01:35.800
Oh, no. Wild Knuckles.

00:01:38.480 --> 00:01:39.640
(COUGHS)

00:01:39.680 --> 00:01:42.600
Hey. You're gonna be OK, right?

00:01:42.640 --> 00:01:46.080
Don't worry about me, kid.
I'll be fine.

00:01:47.080 --> 00:01:51.560
Finally. You're going away
for a long, long time.

00:01:51.600 --> 00:01:54.080
Yeah, well, I wouldn't bet on it.

00:01:55.400 --> 00:01:59.000
No.
See you soon, kiddo.

00:01:59.040 --> 00:02:01.760
(SIREN WAILS)

00:02:02.880 --> 00:02:04.800
(SPEAK MINIONESE)

00:02:04.840 --> 00:02:06.960
(SUCKS TEETH)
(SIGHS SADLY)

00:02:09.160 --> 00:02:11.720
(SLOW, SOMBRE MUSIC)

00:02:18.480 --> 00:02:21.720
# SINGING IN MINIONESE:
You Can't Always Get What You Want #

00:02:31.280 --> 00:02:32.480
(CLEARS THROAT)

00:02:32.520 --> 00:02:35.440
Wild Knuckles
was my favourite villain.

00:02:36.720 --> 00:02:39.880
We didn't have much time together,

00:02:39.920 --> 00:02:43.760
but the time we did have
I'm so grateful for.

00:02:43.800 --> 00:02:45.360
(TEARFUL INHALE)

00:02:45.400 --> 00:02:47.680
I've been thinking about
how you won't see me grow up,

00:02:47.760 --> 00:02:50.240
or be there
for all the terrible things

00:02:50.280 --> 00:02:52.040
that I'm going to do.

00:02:52.120 --> 00:02:53.520
And believe me...
(SOBS)

00:02:53.560 --> 00:02:55.840
there are gonna be
some awful things.

00:03:04.040 --> 00:03:05.440
(CLEARS THROAT)

00:03:05.480 --> 00:03:07.840
But I'm going to make you proud.

00:03:07.880 --> 00:03:12.040
I'm going to be the
best villain ever because of you.

00:03:13.120 --> 00:03:18.440
Because YOU taught me what matters.
You can't do anything alone.

00:03:20.160 --> 00:03:25.880
Find your tribe,
and never, ever let them go.

00:03:25.920 --> 00:03:27.600
(CHEEPS)
Otto?

00:03:28.600 --> 00:03:30.480
Si.

00:03:30.520 --> 00:03:34.720
(VOCALISES IN MINIONESE)

00:03:42.560 --> 00:03:44.520
(CHAOTIC CHATTER)

00:03:44.560 --> 00:03:46.480
(THUD)
(AWKWARDLY GRUMBLING)

00:03:52.120 --> 00:03:54.160
(EFFORT GRUNTS) (CHATTER)

00:03:54.200 --> 00:03:55.840
(SCREAMS)
(THUD)

00:03:55.880 --> 00:03:56.880
(EFFORT GRUNT)

00:03:59.200 --> 00:04:01.520
(VOCALISES IN MINIONESE)

00:04:04.440 --> 00:04:06.920
(ALL SING IN MINIONESE)

00:04:11.200 --> 00:04:14.160
You better stay out of trouble, kid.

00:04:14.200 --> 00:04:19.120
I will lead a good and honest life.
(SNICKERS)

00:04:20.120 --> 00:04:22.120
(GASPS)
You're alive?!

00:04:22.160 --> 00:04:23.800
Oh!
(CHUCKLES)

00:04:24.960 --> 00:04:27.720
You just blew my mind!
How did you do that?

00:04:27.760 --> 00:04:28.960
(GIGGLES)

00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:33.080
I cannot wait to fake my own death
to avoid the authorities!

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:36.040
Shoot for the moon, kid.
Shoot for the moon.

00:04:37.440 --> 00:04:40.920
(CHUCKLES)
See you later, suckers!

00:04:40.960 --> 00:04:43.400
ALL: Whoo-hoo!

00:04:45.640 --> 00:04:47.600
(PANICKED MINIONESE)

00:04:49.800 --> 00:04:52.720
# ROLLING STONES:
You Can't Always Get What You Want #

00:05:09.800 --> 00:05:12.240
(BELL RINGS)
Sorry, we're closed.

00:05:12.280 --> 00:05:14.040
(SPLAT)
Oh!

00:05:14.080 --> 00:05:18.400
I just wanted to thank you for this.
Worked like a charm.

00:05:18.480 --> 00:05:20.360
All right,
let me cut to the chase here.

00:05:20.400 --> 00:05:23.840
I need a genius mad scientist.
You want to come work for me?

00:05:23.880 --> 00:05:28.680
No, I am done with villainy.
Off to happier horizons.

00:05:28.720 --> 00:05:30.400
Goodbye, little chap.

00:05:31.400 --> 00:05:33.520
Por favor.

00:05:35.040 --> 00:05:36.680
(WHIMPERS)

00:05:36.720 --> 00:05:38.480
(ALL WHIMPER)

00:05:38.520 --> 00:05:41.320
(TWITTERS GENTLY)

00:05:41.360 --> 00:05:43.080
(TWEETS)

00:05:43.120 --> 00:05:45.680
Oh, all right, all right. Fine.

00:05:45.720 --> 00:05:47.760
Stop with the face. I'm in.

00:05:48.760 --> 00:05:50.680
Wanna see something cool?

00:05:50.720 --> 00:05:54.360
(CAR SPEEDS AWAY)
(DRAMATIC, SINISTER MUSIC)

00:05:57.520 --> 00:05:59.680
Oh! Are you kidding me?

00:06:05.080 --> 00:06:07.440
(EXCITED GIGGLES)

00:06:07.480 --> 00:06:10.240
CHANTING: Big Boss! Big Boss!

00:06:10.280 --> 00:06:12.920
Big Boss! I like that!
(LAUGHS)

